  "body": "<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- feat(config): preserve unknown nested fields as comments during v8 migration (48686ccc)\n- fix(codex): normalize empty function call arguments in responses requests (5d8bb3d9)\n- fix(claude): remap MCP aliases in tool_addition/tool_removal blocks (958eeca7)\n- feat(codex): extract and persist subscription plan type (59baf731)\n- feat(sdk): add Home credential capabilities and quota APIs (b9971ee3)\n- fix(codex): use resolved compat for multi-agent v2 (d3cd466d)\n- Merge pull request #6175 from magoz/fix/claude-oauth-tool-change-alias (e8156ec7)\n- fix(openai): use routed home model compatibility options (ac42accc)\n- Merge pull request #6176 from router-for-me/home (673e58d5)\n- feat(logging): switch request ID generation to UUIDv7 (d33f63f8)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(claude): remap MCP aliases in tool_addition/tool_removal blocks by @magoz in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/6175\n* Add Home credential capabilities and quota APIs by @hkfires in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/6176\n\n## New Contributors\n* @magoz made their first contribution in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/6175\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v8.0.3...v8.0.4\n",
